                <div type="edition" xml:lang="okz-Latn" rendition="class:83231 maturity:83213">
                   <p>
   <lb n="1"/>sabvamasatu jaiyāsaditireka 1544 caha na-
                      <lb n="2"/>ksatra khae bhadraputra 15 roca thṅaiya A-
                      <lb n="3"/>… sā-
                      <lb n="4"/>raddhā sūma luha prāddhanā smoḥha caboḥha
                      <lb n="5"/>pāna dana braḥ sīĀramaitrīya bodh(ī)sattva
                      <lb n="6"/>braḥ Aṅga moka trāsa dha(r)mma thm(ī) sūma pāna jā
                      <lb n="7"/>braḥ bud hoṅa
                   </p>
</div>
